    {
      "q": "Why should protest be peaceful?",
      "a": "Peaceful protest keeps people safe, wins public support and respects others' rights. Researchers Erica Chenoweth and Maria Stephan found nonviolent campaigns from 1900 to 2006 succeeded about twice as often as violent ones.",
